  "slug": "best-sloppy-joes",
  "name": "Best Sloppy Joes",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "This sloppy joe recipe is quick and easy and will become a household-favorite. Serve on hamburger buns.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes; drain and discard grease."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Mix ketchup, chili sauce, onion, green bell pepper, brown sugar, and mustard powder into ground beef; bring to a boil. Reduce heat and simmer until flavors have blended, about 15 minutes; serve on hamburger buns."
    }
  ],
